### Order Management Endpoints Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json
@token = <paste-customer-token-here>
@admin_token = <paste-admin-token-here>

###
### CHECKOUT - Create Order from Cart (ACID Transaction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### @name checkoutOrder
# After running this, save the order ID for later operations
@order_id = 

###
### GET ORDER HISTORY
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### GET ORDER HISTORY - WITH PAGINATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?skip=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### GET ORDER HISTORY - FILTER BY STATUS (Pending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### GET ORDER HISTORY - FILTER BY STATUS (Delivered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### GET ORDER HISTORY - COMBINED FILTERS
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?skip=0&limit=5&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### UPDATE ORDER STATUS TO SHIPPED (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status?new_status=shipped
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### UPDATE ORDER STATUS TO DELIVERED (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status?new_status=delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### CANCEL PENDING ORDER (User Owned)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ERROR TEST: CHECKOUT WITH EMPTY CART
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ERROR TEST: CHECKOUT WITHOUT TOKEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ERROR TEST: CANCEL NON-EXISTENT ORDER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/99999/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ERROR TEST: CANCEL ALREADY SHIPPED ORDER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ERROR TEST: UPDATE STATUS WITHOUT ADMIN TOKEN
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status?new_status=shipped
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### TRANSACTION SAFETY TEST: Add to cart, checkout, verify stock decreased
# Step 1: Get product details before checkout
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

###
### TRANSACTION SAFETY TEST: Checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### TRANSACTION SAFETY TEST: Get product details after checkout (stock should decrease)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

###
### TRANSACTION SAFETY TEST: Verify cart is empty after checkout
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}